Subject: [PATCH 03/31] test(verimark): ship the standalone TDD test suite and
 meson.build

The 11-file test/ directory and the standalone meson.build that drives
it weren't included in the previous vfuncs commit ; this brings the
proto-layer unit tests into the libfprint fork so contributors can
verify the wire format without the full libfprint build.

Run from this directory :

    meson setup --werror build
    meson test -C build

Coverage : 10 suites (proto, crypto, tls, pairing, session, handshake,
storage, capture, match, enroll), 94 tests total. Loopback-mock pattern
synthesizes encrypted sensor responses via an "alice/bob" key-block
swap so every wrapper's request layout AND response parser is asserted
bit-exact against the byte layouts documented in docs/opcodes/*.yaml.

The standalone meson.build is independent of the parent libfprint
build (drivers are registered through libfprint/meson.build of the
fork). No-op when libfprint is built normally ; opt-in for protocol
verification.

Drafted with AI assistance.
